   Niermann, Christina, Med Sch Hamburg, Inst Interdisciplinary Exercise Sci \& Sports Med, Hamburg, Germany.
   Schmitz, Julian, Res Inst Reg \& Urban Dev gGmbH, Dortmund, Germany.},
